WEBVTT

00:07.767 --> 00:09.033
- Are you ready, kids?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:09.100 --> 00:10.733
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:10.800 --> 00:12.200
- I can't hear you.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:12.267 --> 00:14.367
all:
Aye, aye, Captain!
全部：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:14.433 --> 00:17.200
- * Ohh... *
-*哦...*

00:17.267 --> 00:19.300
* Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? *
*谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ *

00:19.367 --> 00:21.300
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:21.367 --> 00:23.200
- * Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he *
- * 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的*

00:23.267 --> 00:25.133
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:25.200 --> 00:27.133
- * If nautical nonsense
be something you wish *
- *如果航海废话
成为你所希望的*

00:27.200 --> 00:29.000
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:29.067 --> 00:31.267
- * Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish *
- * 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通 *

00:31.333 --> 00:33.300
all: SpongeBob SquarePants!
- Ready?
所有：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:33.367 --> 00:35.167
all:
SpongeBob SquarePants!
全部：
海绵宝宝！

00:35.233 --> 00:37.500
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:37.567 --> 00:39.433
SpongeBob SquarePants!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.500 --> 00:40.767
- SpongeBob
- 海绵宝宝

00:40.833 --> 00:42.633
SquarePants!
方裤！

00:42.700 --> 00:45.367
[laughing]
[笑]

00:45.433 --> 00:47.667
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:47.733 --> 00:49.300
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:51.767 --> 00:54.700
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

00:54.767 --> 00:59.900
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

01:00.067 --> 01:01.667
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

01:01.733 --> 01:03.767
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:03.833 --> 01:05.267
Huh?
啊？

01:05.333 --> 01:07.767
Mm, I don't remember
this bottle.
嗯，我不记得了
这瓶。

01:07.833 --> 01:08.800
[pop]
[流行音乐]

01:08.867 --> 01:10.333
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

01:10.400 --> 01:11.700
- Poof!
- 噗！

01:11.767 --> 01:13.767
Alakazam!
阿拉卡扎姆！

01:13.833 --> 01:15.633
Your wish is my command.
你的愿望就是我的命令。

01:15.700 --> 01:17.633
[beeping]
[嘟嘟声]

01:17.700 --> 01:19.133
[buzzer blares]
[蜂鸣器鸣响]

01:19.200 --> 01:21.067
- I wish you
back in the bottle.
- 我希望你
回到瓶子里。

01:21.067 --> 01:23.933
- Ow!
- 噢！

01:24.067 --> 01:25.400
Hey, cut it out.
嘿，剪掉吧。

01:25.467 --> 01:28.400
- All right, what's with
the Ali Baba routine?
- 好吧，有什么关系
阿里巴巴的套路？

01:28.467 --> 01:30.500
- It's my new scheme, Karen.
- 这是我的新计划，凯伦。

01:30.567 --> 01:32.500
I get Krabs to believe
I'm a genie,
我让蟹蟹们相信
我是一个精灵，

01:32.567 --> 01:35.700
I break this bottle,
and then he's gonna put me
我打破了这个瓶子
然后他就会把我

01:35.767 --> 01:37.433
in another bottle.
在另一个瓶子里。

01:37.500 --> 01:41.933
- I hope it's a baby bottle
because you look adorable.
- 我希望这是一个婴儿奶瓶
因为你看起来很可爱。

01:42.067 --> 01:45.733
- No, Karen, you hope
it's the secret formula bottle
- 不，凯伦，你希望
这是秘密配方奶瓶

01:45.800 --> 01:48.900
because then we'll rule
the fast food world!
因为那时我们将统治
快餐世界！

01:48.967 --> 01:51.267
- Yeah, keep messing
with that old crab,
- 是的，继续搞砸
和那只老螃蟹一起，

01:51.333 --> 01:54.633
and the only container
you'll need is an urn.
和唯一的容器
你需要的是一个骨灰盒。

01:54.700 --> 01:55.633
- Ow!
- 噢！

01:55.700 --> 01:57.100
[clink]
[碰杯]

01:57.167 --> 01:58.600
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

01:58.667 --> 02:00.067
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

02:00.067 --> 02:01.733
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:01.800 --> 02:05.667
Krabs should be heading
out for work right about now.
螃蟹应该去
马上就出去工作了。

02:05.733 --> 02:06.667
[grunts]
[咕哝]

02:06.733 --> 02:08.067
[pop]
[流行音乐]

02:08.900 --> 02:10.133
[pop]
[流行音乐]

02:10.900 --> 02:13.067
- [yawns]
- [哈欠]

02:13.133 --> 02:15.300
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:15.367 --> 02:17.667
- Mm.
Hmph.
- 毫米。
哼。

02:17.733 --> 02:18.700
Mm!
毫米！

02:18.767 --> 02:19.767
- [slurp]
- [咕噜咕噜]

02:19.833 --> 02:21.067
[shattering]
[破碎]

02:21.133 --> 02:22.833
- [giggles]
[rooster crows]
- [咯咯笑]
[公鸡打鸣]

02:22.900 --> 02:24.100
- Ow!
- 噢！

02:24.167 --> 02:26.667
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

02:26.733 --> 02:27.967
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇哇哇！

02:28.067 --> 02:30.633
[screaming]
[尖叫]

02:30.700 --> 02:33.533
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:33.600 --> 02:36.167
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

02:36.233 --> 02:37.700
Ow, ow, ow!
噢，噢，噢！

02:38.633 --> 02:40.733
- SpongeBob, pick up that trash.
- 海绵宝宝，把垃圾捡起来。

02:40.800 --> 02:42.967
- And a good morning
to you, Mr. Krabs.
- 早上好
给你，蟹老板。

02:43.067 --> 02:45.967
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

02:46.067 --> 02:48.233
- [gasps]
Whoa, it's so pretty.
- [喘气]
哇，真漂亮。

02:48.300 --> 02:50.667
- Oh, no, that's SpongeBob.
- 哦，不，那是海绵宝宝。

02:50.733 --> 02:52.067
Oof, oof!
噢噢噢！

02:52.100 --> 02:54.333
[pinging]
[ping]
[ping]
[平]

02:54.400 --> 02:58.433
- I'm going home
for my lunch break, Mr. Krabs.
- 我要回家了
蟹老板，我的午休时间。

02:58.500 --> 02:59.567
[pop]
[流行音乐]

02:59.633 --> 03:01.067
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

03:01.100 --> 03:05.067
- Ugh, nagging Neptune,
the agony!
- 呃，唠叨的海王星，
痛苦！

03:05.133 --> 03:06.633
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

03:06.700 --> 03:08.433
- [laughing]
- [笑]

03:08.500 --> 03:11.867
- Whatever's happening,
I'm sure it will be over soon.
- 无论发生什么，
我确信一切很快就会结束。

03:11.933 --> 03:14.667
- [laughing]
- [笑]

03:14.733 --> 03:15.833
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

03:15.900 --> 03:17.500
[clinking]
[叮叮当当]

03:17.567 --> 03:18.900
Ooh, huh?
哦，是吗？

03:18.967 --> 03:19.900
- Meow.
- 喵。

03:19.967 --> 03:21.733
- [laughs]
Huh?
- [笑]
啊？

03:21.800 --> 03:22.733
- Meow.
- 喵。

03:22.800 --> 03:25.100
- [laughs]
Ooh.
- [笑]
哦。

03:25.167 --> 03:27.333
- [sighs]
Meow.
- [叹气]
喵。

03:27.400 --> 03:29.133
- Hey, there's writing on this.
- 嘿，有关于这个的文字。

03:29.200 --> 03:32.733
"Rub bottle for magic genie."
“为魔法精灵擦瓶子。”

03:32.800 --> 03:33.733
Magic genie!
魔法精灵！

03:33.800 --> 03:34.967
I found a genie!
我发现了一个精灵！

03:35.067 --> 03:36.733
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

03:36.800 --> 03:38.100
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

03:38.167 --> 03:40.833
- Ow, ow, hot, hot, hot,
ow, ow, ow!
- 噢，噢，热，热，热，
噢，噢，噢！

03:40.900 --> 03:42.067
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

03:42.067 --> 03:43.067
[sizzling]
[嘶嘶声]

03:43.067 --> 03:44.067
- Yeow!
- 哟！

03:44.067 --> 03:45.433
Alakazam!
阿拉卡扎姆！

03:45.500 --> 03:48.767
I am the genie
of the bottle.
我是精灵
瓶子的。

03:48.833 --> 03:50.533
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

03:50.600 --> 03:53.067
- Oh, yeah!
- 哦，是的！

03:53.067 --> 03:54.333
Hi, genie!
嗨，精灵！

03:54.400 --> 03:57.200
Are you really a genie?
你真的是精灵吗？

03:57.267 --> 03:59.500
- Of course I am.
- 我当然是。

03:59.567 --> 04:04.067
Now, as a genie,
I command you to take me
现在，作为一个精灵，
我命令你带我

04:04.133 --> 04:06.367
to Mr. Krabs.
给蟹老板。

04:06.433 --> 04:08.233
- You silly genie, you.
- 你这个愚蠢的精灵。

04:08.300 --> 04:09.767
You know it doesn't
work like that.
你知道它不会
像那样工作。

04:09.833 --> 04:11.967
I'm your master now,
and you have to grant me
我现在是你的主人了
你必须允许我

04:12.067 --> 04:12.967
three wishes.
三个愿望。

04:13.067 --> 04:14.200
- What?
- 什么？

04:14.267 --> 04:15.600
For cryin' out loud.
因为大声哭泣。

04:15.667 --> 04:18.500
All right, what would you like?
好吧，你想要什么？

04:18.567 --> 04:20.233
- Oh, nothing for me, thank you.
- 哦，对我来说没什么，谢谢。

04:20.300 --> 04:21.800
That would be selfish.
那将是自私的。

04:21.867 --> 04:24.300
But I will make three wishes
for my friends.
但我会许三个愿望
为了我的朋友们。

04:24.367 --> 04:26.867
Friendship is magical too.
友谊也很神奇。

04:26.933 --> 04:28.133
- I'm gonna be sick.
- 我会生病的。

04:28.200 --> 04:29.400
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

04:29.467 --> 04:31.500
- Ow, ow, ow, ow!
[knocking]
- 噢，噢，噢，噢！
[敲门声]

04:31.567 --> 04:34.067
- What do you want?
It's my day off!
- 你想要什么？
今天是我的休息日！

04:34.133 --> 04:36.400
- Well now it's
your lucky day off.
- 现在是这样
你幸运的休息日。

04:36.467 --> 04:37.867
Make a wish,
and the genie
许个愿，
和精灵

04:37.933 --> 04:39.267
shall make it come true.
将使之实现。

04:39.333 --> 04:41.067
- Anything to get you away.
- 任何能让你离开的事情。

04:41.067 --> 04:44.667
I wish for a golden clarinet
that always plays beautifully.
我想要一支金色的单簧管
总是演奏得很漂亮。

04:44.733 --> 04:45.700
There.
那里。

04:45.767 --> 04:46.733
- Say it.
- 说吧。

04:46.800 --> 04:47.900
Mm!
毫米！

04:47.967 --> 04:49.067
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

04:49.133 --> 04:52.600
Your wish is my command!
你的愿望就是我的命令！

04:52.667 --> 04:53.633
[poof]
[噗]

04:53.700 --> 04:54.633
- Yeah!
- 是的！

04:54.700 --> 04:55.633
- So we're done?
- 那么我们就完成了？

04:55.700 --> 04:56.467
[slam]
[猛击]

04:56.533 --> 04:57.967
- Huh?
Genie?
- 啊？
精灵？

04:58.067 --> 04:59.633
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

04:59.700 --> 05:00.800
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:00.867 --> 05:02.633
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:02.700 --> 05:05.467
- Well, I'll be
an ocean monkey's uncle.
- 好吧，我会的
海洋猴的叔叔。

05:05.533 --> 05:08.100
The wish came true!
愿望成真了！

05:08.167 --> 05:11.733
[mysterious music]
[神秘的音乐]

05:11.800 --> 05:15.267
- Good thing I spent
that last summer
- 还好我花了
去年夏天

05:15.333 --> 05:17.367
in evil band camp.
在邪恶乐队营地里。

05:17.433 --> 05:19.267
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:19.333 --> 05:22.867
- Oh, magic is real.
- 哦，魔法是真实的。

05:22.933 --> 05:25.800
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

05:25.867 --> 05:27.767
Oh, Master?
噢，师父？

05:27.833 --> 05:29.433
I have an idea!
我有一个主意！

05:29.500 --> 05:33.500
How about your next friend
is Mr. Krabs?
你的下一个朋友怎么样
是蟹老板吗？

05:33.567 --> 05:36.167
- My next friend
is my best friend.
- 我的下一个朋友
是我最好的朋友。

05:36.233 --> 05:37.933
- Oh, for cod's sake.
- 哦，看在鳕鱼的份上。

05:38.067 --> 05:39.500
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

05:39.567 --> 05:42.733
- I wish...I wish...
- 我希望...我希望...

05:42.800 --> 05:44.667
I wish...
我希望...

05:44.733 --> 05:46.800
- Pick something, you bozo!
- 选择一些东西，你这个笨蛋！

05:46.867 --> 05:51.633
- Well, sometimes I wish
I had an extra head
- 好吧，有时我希望
我多了一个头

05:51.700 --> 05:55.667
so I'd have someone to talk to
when you're at work.
所以我想找个人谈谈
当你在工作时。

05:55.733 --> 05:56.767
- Aww.
- 哇。

05:56.833 --> 05:58.300
- Pathetic.
- 可怜的。

05:58.367 --> 06:02.333
All right, your crummy wish
is my command!
好吧，你那卑劣的愿望
是我的命令！

06:02.400 --> 06:05.467
Give me your hand, Jumbo.
把你的手给我，珍宝。

06:05.533 --> 06:10.333
And the both of you,
close your eyes.
还有你们俩，
闭上你的眼睛。

06:10.400 --> 06:12.133
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

06:12.200 --> 06:14.700
- Alakazam!
- 阿拉卡扎姆！

06:14.767 --> 06:15.833
- Oh!
- 哦！

06:15.900 --> 06:17.567
My extra head!
我的额外头！

06:17.633 --> 06:20.300
It's my wish come true!
这就是我的愿望实现了！

06:20.367 --> 06:24.900
Oh, I'm gonna call you Noggin.
哦，我会叫你诺金。

06:24.967 --> 06:26.233
- Oh, hello, Noggin.
- 哦，你好，诺金。

06:26.300 --> 06:27.500
Nice to meet you.
很高兴见到你。

06:27.567 --> 06:30.667
- Noggin, say hello
to SpongeBob.
- 诺金，打个招呼
海绵宝宝。

06:32.067 --> 06:34.300
- Oh, he doesn't have to--
- Noggin,
- 哦，他不必--
- 诺金，

06:34.367 --> 06:36.400
you're embarrassing me.
你让我很尴尬。

06:36.467 --> 06:39.067
Say hello to SpongeBob.
向海绵宝宝问好。

06:39.133 --> 06:40.200
- No, it's okay, Patrick.
- 不，没关系，帕特里克。

06:40.267 --> 06:41.600
- No, it's not okay!
- 不，这不行！

06:41.667 --> 06:44.733
- Leaping lungfish,
can we go now?
- 跳跃的肺鱼，
我们现在可以走了吗？

06:44.800 --> 06:46.733
- Yes, go!
- 是的，走吧！

06:46.800 --> 06:50.100
Noggin here needs to be
taught a painful lesson.
这里需要有Noggin
给了惨痛的教训。

06:50.167 --> 06:53.800
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

06:53.867 --> 06:55.900
Okay, Mister, you can--
ow!
好吧，先生，你可以——
噢！

06:55.967 --> 06:57.233
Ooh-ho-ho-ho!
哦嗬嗬！

06:57.300 --> 06:59.067
What are you do--?
Ow, ow!
你在做什么——？
噢，噢！

06:59.133 --> 07:01.333
Ow, Noggin, don't!
噢，诺金，别这样！

07:01.400 --> 07:02.500
Oh!
哦！

07:02.567 --> 07:04.300
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

07:04.367 --> 07:06.867
- Finally!
The Krusty Krab.
- 最后！
蟹堡王。

07:06.933 --> 07:08.600
- Of course, I was saving
my last wish
- 当然，我是在存钱
我最后的愿望

07:08.667 --> 07:10.067
for good ol' Mr. Krabs.
老蟹先生。

07:10.067 --> 07:14.267
- Ooh, izzy wizzy,
let's get busy.
- 哦，伊兹维兹，
让我们开始忙碌吧。

07:14.333 --> 07:15.867
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

07:15.933 --> 07:18.333
- And so this would be
the third and last wish I have,
- 所以这就是
我的第三个也是最后一个愿望

07:18.400 --> 07:19.867
and it's all for you.
这一切都是为了你。

07:19.933 --> 07:20.967
[pop]
[流行音乐]

07:21.067 --> 07:21.967
[poof]
[噗]

07:22.067 --> 07:24.067
- Alakazam!
- 阿拉卡扎姆！

07:24.133 --> 07:26.867
- Child, can't you see
I'm working here?
- 孩子，你看不出来吗
我在这里工作？

07:26.933 --> 07:29.433
Take your toy and go
play in the kitchen.
带上你的玩具走吧
在厨房里玩。

07:29.500 --> 07:33.967
- But it's a real genie, and I--
I saved the last wish for you.
- 但它是一个真正的精灵，而且我--
我把最后的心愿都留给了你。

07:34.067 --> 07:35.700
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

07:35.767 --> 07:37.567
- Okay, stop your blubbering.
- 好吧，别哭了。

07:37.633 --> 07:38.800
I'll play along.
我也来一起玩

07:38.867 --> 07:42.233
I wish I had, um, $1,000.
我希望我有，嗯，1,000 美元。

07:42.300 --> 07:46.400
- Your wish is my command!
- 你的愿望就是我的命令！

07:46.467 --> 07:48.067
You greedy crook.
你这个贪婪的骗子。

07:48.133 --> 07:49.400
[poof]
[噗]

07:50.333 --> 07:52.733
I'd like to withdraw
all my money, please.
我想撤回
我所有的钱，拜托了。

07:52.800 --> 07:54.100
[cash register dings]
[收银机叮叮声]

07:54.167 --> 07:57.700
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

07:57.767 --> 08:00.200
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:01.500 --> 08:02.467
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

08:02.533 --> 08:03.567
Well, blow me down.
好吧，把我打倒吧。

08:03.633 --> 08:05.300
It is a real genie!
这是一个真正的精灵！

08:05.367 --> 08:08.933
If I possess that bottle,
I'll get three more wishes!
如果我拥有那瓶酒
我还要实现三个愿望！

08:09.067 --> 08:10.367
- It's mine now!
- 现在是我的了！

08:10.433 --> 08:14.167
With three wishes,
I could rule the music world!
带着三个愿望，
我可以统治音乐世界！

08:14.233 --> 08:15.300
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:15.367 --> 08:17.467
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

08:17.533 --> 08:19.267
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:19.333 --> 08:21.800
What happened to you?
你怎么了？

08:21.867 --> 08:23.633
- I don't wanna talk about it.
- 我不想谈论它。

08:23.700 --> 08:26.333
I just want a new Noggin.
我只想要一个新的诺金。

08:26.400 --> 08:27.833
Oof!
- Got it!
钱币！
- 知道了！

08:27.900 --> 08:30.467
Nyah, nyah,
the genie's mine now!
尼亚，尼亚，
精灵现在是我的了！

08:30.533 --> 08:32.367
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

08:32.433 --> 08:33.433
- Hey, look, a penny!
- 嘿，看，一分钱！

08:33.500 --> 08:34.433
- What?
Money?
- 什么？
钱？

08:34.500 --> 08:35.433
Where?
在哪里？

08:35.500 --> 08:36.433
- Ooh.
- 哦。

08:36.500 --> 08:38.267
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

08:38.333 --> 08:43.067
Now hand me the bottle!
现在把瓶子递给我！

08:43.067 --> 08:44.367
- No, Mr. Krabs.
- 不，蟹老板。

08:44.433 --> 08:46.067
Oh, don't you all see?
哦，你们都没有看到吗？

08:46.100 --> 08:47.633
We shouldn't be fighting.
我们不应该打架。

08:47.700 --> 08:50.533
Today we found out
that magic is real.
今天我们发现
那个魔法是真实的。

08:50.600 --> 08:53.767
And that magic is magical
and that magic makes you
那魔法真是神奇
那魔力让你

08:53.833 --> 08:58.067
feel all sparkly
and carbonated inside.
感觉一切都闪闪发光
并在里面碳酸化。

08:58.067 --> 09:00.133
- [retches]
- [干呕]

09:00.200 --> 09:02.733
- So how do we decide
who gets the genie?
- 那么我们如何决定
谁得到了精灵？

09:02.800 --> 09:04.467
- That's easy.
We're gonna play
- 这很容易。
我们要玩

09:04.533 --> 09:06.133
a little game called
Spin The Bottle!
一个小游戏叫
旋转瓶子！

09:06.200 --> 09:07.267
- [exclaiming]
- [惊呼]

09:08.200 --> 09:12.100
- So the rules are whichever one
the bottle points to...
- 所以规则是任意的
瓶子指向...

09:12.167 --> 09:13.533
- Has to kiss!
- 必须接吻！

09:13.600 --> 09:16.400
- No, Patrick, they win
the bottle.
- 不，帕特里克，他们赢了
瓶子。

09:16.467 --> 09:17.400
- Oh.
- 哦。

09:17.467 --> 09:19.133
- And spin!
- 旋转！

09:19.200 --> 09:20.567
- [gagging]
- [作呕]

09:20.633 --> 09:22.233
- Ooh, ooh...
- 哦，哦...

09:22.300 --> 09:24.633
- Mm...
- 毫米...

09:24.700 --> 09:26.500
- [laughing]
- [笑]

09:26.567 --> 09:29.133
- Stop on me, stop on me...
- 停下来，停下来……

09:29.200 --> 09:30.700
- It's mine, it's mine!
- 这是我的，这是我的！

09:30.767 --> 09:32.300
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

09:32.367 --> 09:33.300
- It's coming back!
- 它回来了！

09:33.367 --> 09:34.333
It's coming to me!
它来找我了！

09:34.400 --> 09:36.167
Yes, it's mine!
是的，它是我的！

09:36.233 --> 09:37.200
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

09:37.267 --> 09:38.900
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

09:38.967 --> 09:43.300
All right, abracadabra!
Hocus pocus!
好吧，胡言乱语！
戏法！

09:43.367 --> 09:45.100
Open sesame!
芝麻开门！

09:45.167 --> 09:48.067
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

09:48.067 --> 09:52.567
Al--Alakazoom!
阿尔——阿拉卡祖姆！

09:52.633 --> 09:55.800
Your swish is my com--my com--
你的嗖嗖是我的通讯——我的通讯——

09:55.867 --> 09:58.467
* My wishy wishy
wishy wish fish! *
*我的如意如意
祝愿鱼！ *

09:58.533 --> 10:00.033
[blows a raspberry]
[吹覆盆子]

10:00.033 --> 10:00.067
[blows a raspberry]
- All right, Alakazam,
first thing I want
[吹覆盆子]
- 好吧，阿拉卡扎姆，
我想要的第一件事

10:00.067 --> 10:02.733
- All right, Alakazam,
first thing I want
- 好吧，阿拉卡扎姆，
我想要的第一件事

10:02.800 --> 10:04.367
is for everything
in the Krusty Krab
是为了一切
在蟹堡王

10:04.433 --> 10:08.667
to turn into gold--
even all the negative space.
变成金子——
甚至所有的负空间。

10:09.467 --> 10:10.933
- I can't do it!
- 我做不到！

10:11.000 --> 10:13.500
I can't keep up
this charade anymore.
我跟不上
不再这样了。

10:13.567 --> 10:16.267
I'm too mangled and mutilated.
我太伤痕累累了。

10:16.333 --> 10:18.633
- Oh, I should have known!
- 哦，我早该知道的！

10:18.700 --> 10:21.833
What was your lame-o plan
this time?
你的蹩脚计划是什么
这次？

10:21.900 --> 10:23.433
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

10:23.500 --> 10:26.100
I was gonna break that bottle
so you would have to put me
我本来想打破那个瓶子
所以你必须把我

10:26.167 --> 10:28.067
in the bottle
with the secret formula.
在瓶子里
与秘密公式。

10:28.133 --> 10:29.167
[shimmering]
[闪烁]

10:29.233 --> 10:30.233
[thunder rumbles]
[雷声隆隆]

10:30.300 --> 10:32.900
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:32.967 --> 10:37.600
- So you were gonna break
my bottle, eh?
- 所以你会崩溃的
我的瓶子，嗯？

10:37.667 --> 10:39.800
That's the last time
I go on vacation
这是最后一次
我去度假

10:39.867 --> 10:44.300
and sublet my bottle to someone
without references.
并将我的瓶子转租给某人
没有参考文献。

10:44.367 --> 10:46.700
[thunder rumbles]
[雷声隆隆]

10:46.767 --> 10:47.933
What did you do to it?
你对它做了什么？

10:48.000 --> 10:49.800
It's all chipped and scratched!
全部都是缺口和划痕！

10:49.867 --> 10:52.700
- Calm down, you're insured.
- 冷静点，你有保险。

10:52.767 --> 10:55.000
- Who's this clod
with my bottle?
- 这块土块是谁
用我的瓶子？

10:55.067 --> 10:57.667
- Who's that bottle
with my clod?
- 那瓶是谁的
和我的土块？

10:57.733 --> 10:59.067
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

10:59.133 --> 11:00.367
- Hmm...
- 唔...

11:00.433 --> 11:01.533
[thunder rumbles]
[雷声隆隆]

11:01.600 --> 11:05.733
So you all like bottles, eh?
所以你们都喜欢瓶子，是吗？

11:05.800 --> 11:07.433
[electric crackling]
[电击爆裂声]

11:07.500 --> 11:10.500
[exclaiming]
[惊呼]

11:10.567 --> 11:13.067
[electric crackling]
[电击爆裂声]

11:13.100 --> 11:14.533
[clink]
[碰杯]

11:14.600 --> 11:16.400
Oh, poor baby.
哦，可怜的宝贝。

11:16.467 --> 11:19.900
Next time I'll take you
with me to visit Mama.
下次我带你去
和我一起去看望妈妈。

11:19.967 --> 11:20.900
[snap]
[折断]

11:20.967 --> 11:22.433
[poof]
[噗]

11:22.500 --> 11:24.067
- Hey, you guys, I--huh?
- 嘿，你们，我——嗯？

11:24.067 --> 11:26.067
Hmm, guess they worked it out.
嗯，猜猜他们已经解决了。

11:26.100 --> 11:29.867
It's so heartwarming to live
in a world with real magic.
活着真是让人心旷神怡
在一个真正有魔法的世界里。

11:29.933 --> 11:33.067
And the greatest magic of all
is the way my friends
以及最伟大的魔法
这就是我朋友们的方式

11:33.067 --> 11:35.200
are so close to each other.
彼此如此接近。

11:35.267 --> 11:36.433
[clink]
[碰杯]

11:36.500 --> 11:38.200
[faint shouting]
[微弱的喊叫]

11:38.267 --> 11:41.767
all: [exclaiming]
全体：[惊呼]

11:41.833 --> 11:44.333
- Yuck, this bottle
of ketchup's gone bad.
- 恶心，这瓶
番茄酱变质了。

11:44.400 --> 11:46.600
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

[嗡嗡声]